 the total outstanding claims on and liabilities to foreign countries are each presented.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [86, 618, 748, 702], \"page_id\": 62}], \"content\": \"Section III presents details with respect to capital movements and short-term claims and liabilities. These are shown for the latest month for which final data are\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [841, 169, 1500, 219], \"page_id\": 62}], \"content\": \"available and the latest month for which preliminary data are available.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [842, 242, 1496, 326], \"page_id\": 62}], \"content\": \"Section IV contains data for recent months on outstanding contracts of banks for forward purchases and sales of foreign exchange.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [837, 353, 1501, 536], \"page_id\": 62}], \"content\": \"The data in these four sections are based on reports filed each month by banks, bankers, and brokers throughout the United States. The reports are collected, checked, and tabulated by the twelve Federal Reserve Banks. The totals are then forwarded to the Treasury Department for consolidation and publication.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 8, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [841, 552, 1500, 695], \"page_id\": 62}], \"content\": \"Publication of detailed figures on capital movements was discontinued between the March 1942 and the November 1945 issues of the \\\"Treasury Bulletin\\\", but data omitted during that period were supplied in the November 1945 issue and supplement.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 9, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [577, 746, 998, 784], \"page_id\": 62}], \"content\": \"Section I - Historical Summary\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 10, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [255, 787, 1320, 814], \"page