metry raises questions about the consistency of the data reporting.\n\nI'll investigate the original source to verify the monthly breakdown for investment expenditures in the latter half of 1948.\n","signature":""},{"type":"toolRequest","id":"call_00ac3bd0f17d48b5b0bf4799","toolCall":{"status":"success","value":{"name":"shell","arguments":{"command":"cat /app/resources/treasury_bulletin_1949_03_page_18.txt"}}},"_meta":{"goose_extension":"developer"}}],"metadata":{"userVisible":true,"agentVisible":true}}}
